\f1\fs22 Dr Carpenter\'92s face transformed as his eyes moved over it. \'93
\f3\i The son of God, I am
\f1\i0 ,\'94 he translated, then contemplated the words for a few moments, nodding gently. Then he took the Sharpie from Chilo\'92s hand without being offered it, and wrote beneath the line, unhurried, and turned the page back around.\
Kathy and the Sages jostled to read it.\
